  ('Etken cümlesi "Who is going to chair tomorrow\'s emergency board meeting?" olan sorunun edilgen karşılığı aşağıdakilerden hangisidir?', 'Who is tomorrow\'s emergency board meeting going to be chaired by?', ['Who is going tomorrow\'s emergency board meeting to be chaired?', 'By whom tomorrow\'s emergency board meeting is going to chair?', 'Who will tomorrow\'s emergency board meeting been chaired by?'], '\'Be going to\' içeren \'Who\' özne sorusu edilgene çevrilirken \'Who + is + yeni özne + going to be + V3 + by?\' dizilimi izlenir.'),
