  ('Aşağıdaki cümlelerin hangisinde \'marry\' veya \'graduate\' fiillerinin kullanımıyla ilgili yaygın edilgen/edat hatasından KAÇINILMIŞ, doğru bir yapı kurulmuştur?', 'Clarissa has been married to an acoustic engineer from Vienna for twelve years.', ['Clarissa was married with an acoustic engineer from Vienna twelve years ago.', 'Her younger brother was graduated from the naval academy last June.', 'The couple got marry by the mayor in a botanical garden.'], 'İngilizcede evli olma durumu \'be married to someone\' (\'with\' değil) ile kurulur; \'graduate\' ise standart kullanımda etken (\'graduated from\') çekimlenir.'),
