  ('Hangi seçenekteki deyimsel fiil (phrasal verb) edilgen çatıda edatı eksik bırakıldığı için YANLIŞ kullanılmıştır?', 'The elderly patients in the ward were lovingly looked by two night nurses.', ['The controversial clause was eventually left out of the final treaty.', 'All deceptive advertisements must be done away with immediately.', 'His innovative proposal was turned down by the finance committee.'], '\'Look after\' (ilgilenmek, bakmak) fiilindeki \'after\' edatı atılamaz; \'were lovingly looked after by...\' denmeliydi.'),
